    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_title",
      "x": 120, "y": 820, "width": 1400, "height": 34,
      "text": "FOUNDATION  —  how a single clue changes the confidence numbers (this is GeoBayes, the engine DST runs in step 3)",
      "originalText": "FOUNDATION  —  how a single clue changes the confidence numbers (this is GeoBayes, the engine DST runs in step 3)",
      "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200001,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200002, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_intuition",
      "x": 120, "y": 866, "width": 640, "height": 150,
      "text": "THE IDEA IN ONE SENTENCE\n\nEvery clue votes on every guess with a score from 1 to 5:\n\n  5 = 'this strongly SUPPORTS the guess'\n  3 = 'this says NOTHING either way' (neutral)\n  1 = 'this strongly CONTRADICTS the guess'\n\nWe multiply each guess's confidence by a number\nbuilt from that score. Support pushes it up,\ncontradiction pulls it down, neutral leaves it alone.",
      "originalText": "THE IDEA IN ONE SENTENCE\n\nEvery clue votes on every guess with a score from 1 to 5:\n\n  5 = 'this strongly SUPPORTS the guess'\n  3 = 'this says NOTHING either way' (neutral)\n  1 = 'this strongly CONTRADICTS the guess'\n\nWe multiply each guess's confidence by a number\nbuilt from that score. Support pushes it up,\ncontradiction pulls it down, neutral leaves it alone.",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200003,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200004, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.4
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s2_formula",
      "x": 800, "y": 866, "width": 620, "height": 170,
      "strokeColor": "#6d28d9", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200005,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200006, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "s2_formula_t", "type": "text"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_formula_t",
      "x": 820, "y": 882, "width": 580, "height": 140,
      "text": "THE ACTUAL FORMULA  (config.py: BETA = 0.693 = ln 2)\n\n  W(clue | guess) = exp[ alpha * beta * (c - 3) ]\n\n     c     = the 1-5 score      (c-3 centers it: 3 -> 0)\n     alpha = how much we trust this clue (0..1)\n     beta  = ln 2  ->  a full 'support' roughly DOUBLES\n\n  new_confidence(guess)  =  old_confidence(guess) * W\n  ...then rescale all guesses so they sum to 1.",
      "originalText": "THE ACTUAL FORMULA  (config.py: BETA = 0.693 = ln 2)\n\n  W(clue | guess) = exp[ alpha * beta * (c - 3) ]\n\n     c     = the 1-5 score      (c-3 centers it: 3 -> 0)\n     alpha = how much we trust this clue (0..1)\n     beta  = ln 2  ->  a full 'support' roughly DOUBLES\n\n  new_confidence(guess)  =  old_confidence(guess) * W\n  ...then rescale all guesses so they sum to 1.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200007,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200008, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": "s2_formula", "lineHeight": 1.4
    },

    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_why3",
      "x": 800, "y": 1050, "width": 620, "height": 40,
      "text": "WHY subtract 3?  A neutral clue (c=3) gives exp[0] = 1, and multiplying by 1 changes nothing.\nSo useless clues can't accidentally inflate confidence -- only real support or contradiction moves the needle.",
      "originalText": "WHY subtract 3?  A neutral clue (c=3) gives exp[0] = 1, and multiplying by 1 changes nothing.\nSo useless clues can't accidentally inflate confidence -- only real support or contradiction moves the needle.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200009,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200010, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.35
    },

    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_example_label",
      "x": 120, "y": 1075, "width": 640, "height": 26,
      "text": "WORKED EXAMPLE  -  clue: 'left-side driving, red buses'",
      "originalText": "WORKED EXAMPLE  -  clue: 'left-side driving, red buses'",
