    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_votes_t",
      "x": 485, "y": 1130, "width": 270, "height": 120,
      "text": "CLUE VOTES (score c -> W, alpha=1)\n\n  UK    c=5  W=exp[1.39]=4.0  (up!)\n  USA   c=1  W=exp[-1.39]=0.25 (down)\n  Japan c=5  W=exp[1.39]=4.0  (up!)\n\nLeft-driving fits UK & Japan,\ncontradicts the USA.",
      "originalText": "CLUE VOTES (score c -> W, alpha=1)\n\n  UK    c=5  W=exp[1.39]=4.0  (up!)\n  USA   c=1  W=exp[-1.39]=0.25 (down)\n  Japan c=5  W=exp[1.39]=4.0  (up!)\n\nLeft-driving fits UK & Japan,\ncontradicts the USA.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200019,
