      "x": 885, "y": 1130, "width": 220, "height": 120,
      "text": "AFTER (multiply + rescale)\n\n  UK ........ 0.48\n  USA ....... 0.04\n  Japan ..... 0.48\n\nUSA collapsed; UK & Japan\ntied. One clue flipped the\nwinner.",
