    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_takeaway",
      "x": 1150, "y": 1140, "width": 280, "height": 110,
      "text": "WHY multiply instead of just picking the top vote?\n\nMultiplying lets many weak clues stack up, and lets one strong contradiction veto a wrong guess. Confidence carries across clues instead of being thrown away each time.",
      "originalText": "WHY multiply instead of just picking the top vote?\n\nMultiplying lets many weak clues stack up, and lets one strong contradiction veto a wrong guess. Confidence carries across clues instead of being thrown away each time.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200029,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200030, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
