    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s4_knob_t",
      "x": 818, "y": 2286, "width": 584, "height": 140,
      "text": "THE FIX-KNOB:  DST_DISABLE_LEVELS\n\nLists the levels where the Yager fallback is switched off and DST\nalways uses the faithful GeoBayes multiply. Set it to 'continent,country'\nto protect the coarse contrast; leave city/street able to use Yager when\nreal conflict appears (e.g. two street signs in different languages).\n\nEverything here is one env-variable away -- nothing is hard-coded, so\nevery choice can be turned on/off and measured (an 'ablation').",
      "originalText": "THE FIX-KNOB:  DST_DISABLE_LEVELS\n\nLists the levels where the Yager fallback is switched off and DST\nalways uses the faithful GeoBayes multiply. Set it to 'continent,country'\nto protect the coarse contrast; leave city/street able to use Yager when\nreal conflict appears (e.g. two street signs in different languages).\n\nEverything here is one env-variable away -- nothing is hard-coded, so\nevery choice can be turned on/off and measured (an 'ablation').",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a8a", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 400031,
