    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s5_title",
      "x": 120, "y": 2530, "width": 1400, "height": 34,
      "text": "MODULE 1 :  POMDP  -  which clue should we bother checking next?  (modules/pomdp.py)",
      "originalText": "MODULE 1 :  POMDP  -  which clue should we bother checking next?  (modules/pomdp.py)",
      "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 500001,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500002, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s5_intro",
      "x": 120, "y": 2576, "width": 1300, "height": 70,
      "text": "Checking a clue costs time (each check = several AI-model calls). There are many possible clues -- driving side, plants, road signs, architecture...\nWe can't check them all. POMDP is a principled way to ask: 'of the clues I haven't checked yet, which one is most likely to actually settle\nthe question?' It is the classic framework for acting under uncertainty (Kaelbling-Littman-Cassandra 1998).",
      "originalText": "Checking a clue costs time (each check = several AI-model calls). There are many possible clues -- driving side, plants, road signs, architecture...\nWe can't check them all. POMDP is a principled way to ask: 'of the clues I haven't checked yet, which one is most likely to actually settle\nthe question?' It is the classic framework for acting under uncertainty (Kaelbling-Littman-Cassandra 1998).",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 500003,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500004, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.4
    },

