    },

    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s6_title",
      "x": 120, "y": 3220, "width": 1400, "height": 34,
      "text": "THE BIG WHY  -  everything above is really ONE idea: the 'coarse-subtraction hypothesis'",
      "originalText": "THE BIG WHY  -  everything above is really ONE idea: the 'coarse-subtraction hypothesis'",
      "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600001,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600002, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s6_root",
      "x": 120, "y": 3270, "width": 400, "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "#fecaca",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600003,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600004, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "s6_root_t", "type": "text"}, {"id": "s6_arrow1", "type": "arrow"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s6_root_t",
      "x": 138, "y": 3286, "width": 364, "height": 120,
      "text": "THE ROOT PROBLEM\n\nThe AI model was trained on the internet, which is\nheavily US / North-America photos. So on ANY\nphoto it leans toward guessing the USA. It gets\nthe fine details (city, street) roughly right when\nthe country is right -- but it picks the WRONG\ncountry too often, and confidently.",
      "originalText": "THE ROOT PROBLEM\n\nThe AI model was trained on the internet, which is\nheavily US / North-America photos. So on ANY\nphoto it leans toward guessing the USA. It gets\nthe fine details (city, street) roughly right when\nthe country is right -- but it picks the WRONG\ncountry too often, and confidently.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600005,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600006, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": "s6_root", "lineHeight": 1.35
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s6_hypo",
      "x": 570, "y": 3270, "width": 400, "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600007,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600008, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "s6_hypo_t", "type": "text"}, {"id": "s6_arrow1", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "s6_arrow2", "type": "arrow"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s6_hypo_t",
      "x": 588, "y": 3286, "width": 364, "height": 120,
      "text": "THE HYPOTHESIS\n\nThe 3 clever modules (SL, DST, POMDP) were built\nto ADD machinery. But adding machinery on top of a\nbiased coarse guess mostly AMPLIFIES the bias --\nit polishes a wrong answer. The insight: at COARSE\nlevels the win comes from SUBTRACTING (turning\nmachinery off + debiasing), not adding. Add the\nclever stuff back only at fine levels.",
      "originalText": "THE HYPOTHESIS\n\nThe 3 clever modules (SL, DST, POMDP) were built\nto ADD machinery. But adding machinery on top of a\nbiased coarse guess mostly AMPLIFIES the bias --\nit polishes a wrong answer. The insight: at COARSE\nlevels the win comes from SUBTRACTING (turning\nmachinery off + debiasing), not adding. Add the\nclever stuff back only at fine levels.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#78350f", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600009,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600010, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": "s6_hypo", "lineHeight": 1.35
    },

    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "s6_result",
      "x": 1020, "y": 3270, "width": 400, "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 600011,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600012, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "s6_result_t", "type": "text"}, {"id": "s6_arrow2", "type": "arrow"}],
      "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s6_result_t",
      "x": 1038, "y": 3286, "width": 364, "height": 120,
      "text": "THE PLAN OF ATTACK  (all env-gated knobs)\n\n  SL_DISABLE_LEVELS       -> off at coarse\n  DST_DISABLE_LEVELS      -> plain multiply coarse\n  POMDP_COARSE_FIXED_ORDER -> no chasing noise\n  COUNTRY_PRIOR_DEBIAS_GAMMA -> divide out USA\n\nGoal: the pure-MLLM pipeline (no external retrieval)\nBEATS the GeoBayes baseline by fixing the COUNTRY\nstep -- the finer levels already work.",
      "originalText": "THE PLAN OF ATTACK  (all env-gated knobs)\n\n  SL_DISABLE_LEVELS       -> off at coarse\n  DST_DISABLE_LEVELS      -> plain multiply coarse\n  POMDP_COARSE_FIXED_ORDER -> no chasing noise\n  COUNTRY_PRIOR_DEBIAS_GAMMA -> divide out USA\n\nGoal: the pure-MLLM pipeline (no external retrieval)\nBEATS the GeoBayes baseline by fixing the COUNTRY\nstep -- the finer levels already work.",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#065f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
