    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s6_closing",
      "x": 120, "y": 3450, "width": 1300, "height": 60,
      "text": "READ THE WHOLE THING AS:  a table of guesses (Section 2 math) is repeatedly sharpened by clues -- POMDP picks the clue (Sec 5), SL scores it and\nchecks if it's trustworthy (Sec 3), DST folds it into the table safely (Sec 4) -- from continent down to street (Section 1). Every 'clever' piece has a\nknown failure mode on a 7B model, so every piece has an OFF switch, and the current research bet is that turning them off at coarse levels wins.",
      "originalText": "READ THE WHOLE THING AS:  a table of guesses (Section 2 math) is repeatedly sharpened by clues -- POMDP picks the clue (Sec 5), SL scores it and\nchecks if it's trustworthy (Sec 3), DST folds it into the table safely (Sec 4) -- from continent down to street (Section 1). Every 'clever' piece has a\nknown failure mode on a 7B model, so every piece has an OFF switch, and the current research bet is that turning them off at coarse levels wins.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
